DS4 patch: GLM-5.3 approximate expert routing with an exact warm-up
(DS4_GLM_APPROX_WARMUP_TOKENS).

Base: https://github.com/antirez/ds4 commit 0aaea5a238fb41a35106a551e73c8409dfb751ac
Apply from a checkout of that commit:
    git apply ds4-glm53-approx-routing-warmup.patch

Released under the MIT License, the same license as upstream DS4. LICENSE in
this directory is the upstream DS4 license file, unchanged.
See README.md in this directory for what the patch contains, the checks
that were run, and its limitations.

